## Decisions and Action Items

*   **`draft-vos-cfrg-pqpake` Adoption:** The adoption decision for `draft-vos-cfrg-pqpake` will be taken to the CFRG mailing list. Chairs and authors will consult with Security Area Directors regarding the appropriate standardization venue (CFRG vs. a dedicated IETF Working Group).
*   **Fiat-Shamir Draft Feedback:** Watson Ladd to submit text feedback to the mailing list regarding minor structural changes to the Fiat-Shamir draft to enable normative referencing by application drafts (e.g., MOLE).
*   **BBS Signature Draft:** Chairs encouraged final list feedback on the BBS specification as it approaches Working Group Last Call.

